{"id":"575847647ca1a50a","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-bounded-quantifier.md","title":"ZFC Bounded Quantifier","display":"df-zfc-bounded-quantifier — ZFC Bounded Quantifier","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-bounded-quantifier","aliases":["58-df-zfc-bounded-quantifier"],"display":"df-zfc-bounded-quantifier — ZFC Bounded Quantifier","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-bounded-quantifier"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-bounded-quantifier</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-bounded-quantifier — ZFC Bounded Quantifier"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\langle\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{cnst}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},a_{\\mathrm{fn}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},a_{\\mathrm{rel}}\\rangle\\in V\">\\(\\Sigma=\\langle\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{cnst}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},a_{\\mathrm{fn}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},a_{\\mathrm{rel}}\\rangle\\in V\\)</span> (first-order signature)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot\\in\\in\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}}\">\\(\\dot\\in\\in\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}}\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_{\\mathrm{rel}}(\\dot\\in)=2\">\\(a_{\\mathrm{rel}}(\\dot\\in)=2\\)</span> (designated membership-relation symbol)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span> (variable)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (term)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (formula codes)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_S\\in V,\\ \\mathrm{Trm}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}_S:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_S\\in V,\\ \\mathrm{Trm}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}_S:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedQuantifierAt}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedQuantifierAt}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (fully explicit predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedQuantifier}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedQuantifier}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (compatibility projection defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}quantifier\\text{-}explicit}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BoundedQuantifierAt}_S(\\psi,x,t,\\varphi,\\Sigma,\\dot\\in)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\exists\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{cnst}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},a_{\\mathrm{fn}},\n\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},a_{\\mathrm{rel}}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\Sigma=\\langle\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{cnst}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},a_{\\mathrm{fn}},\n\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},a_{\\mathrm{rel}}\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\dot\\in\\in\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}}\n\\land a_{\\mathrm{rel}}(\\dot\\in)=2\n\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\n\\land t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\n\\land\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\Bigl[\n\\psi=\\forall x\\,(\\neg\\dot\\in(x,t)\\lor\\varphi)\n\\lor\n\\psi=\\neg\\forall x\\,\\neg\\neg(\\neg\\dot\\in(x,t)\\lor\\neg\\varphi)\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}quantifier\\text{-}explicit}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BoundedQuantifierAt}_S(\\psi,x,t,\\varphi,\\Sigma,\\dot\\in)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\exists\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{cnst}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},a_{\\mathrm{fn}},\n\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},a_{\\mathrm{rel}}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\Sigma=\\langle\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{cnst}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},a_{\\mathrm{fn}},\n\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},a_{\\mathrm{rel}}\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\dot\\in\\in\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}}\n\\land a_{\\mathrm{rel}}(\\dot\\in)=2\n\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\n\\land t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\n\\land\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\Bigl[\n\\psi=\\forall x\\,(\\neg\\dot\\in(x,t)\\lor\\varphi)\n\\lor\n\\psi=\\neg\\forall x\\,\\neg\\neg(\\neg\\dot\\in(x,t)\\lor\\neg\\varphi)\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}quantifier}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BoundedQuantifier}_S(\\psi,x,t,\\varphi,\\Sigma)\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\dot\\in\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{BoundedQuantifierAt}_S(\\psi,x,t,\\varphi,\\Sigma,\\dot\\in).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}quantifier}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BoundedQuantifier}_S(\\psi,x,t,\\varphi,\\Sigma)\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\dot\\in\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{BoundedQuantifierAt}_S(\\psi,x,t,\\varphi,\\Sigma,\\dot\\in).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The two codes are expanded only with the primitive constructors <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg,\\lor,\\forall\">\\(\\neg,\\lor,\\forall\\)</span> supplied by the formula atom; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot\\in(x,t)\">\\(\\dot\\in(x,t)\\)</span> is a relation-atom code, not the metatheoretic assertion <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in t\">\\(x\\in t\\)</span>. The five-place predicate existentially projects the designated binary symbol for legacy callers.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Var}_S\\in V,\\ \\mathrm{Trm}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}_S:V\\to V$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\langle\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{cnst}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},a_{\\mathrm{fn}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},a_{\\mathrm{rel}}\\rangle\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\dot\\in\\in\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}}","display":false},{"tex":"a_{\\mathrm{rel}}(\\dot\\in)=2","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_S\\in V,\\ \\mathrm{Trm}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}_S:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoundedQuantifierAt}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoundedQuantifier}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}quantifier\\text{-}explicit}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BoundedQuantifierAt}_S(\\psi,x,t,\\varphi,\\Sigma,\\dot\\in)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&\\quad\\exists\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{cnst}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},a_{\\mathrm{fn}},\n\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},a_{\\mathrm{rel}}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\Sigma=\\langle\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{cnst}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},a_{\\mathrm{fn}},\n\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},a_{\\mathrm{rel}}\\rangle\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\dot\\in\\in\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}}\n\\land a_{\\mathrm{rel}}(\\dot\\in)=2\n\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\n\\land t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\n\\land\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\Bigl[\n\\psi=\\forall x\\,(\\neg\\dot\\in(x,t)\\lor\\varphi)\n\\lor\n\\psi=\\neg\\forall x\\,\\neg\\neg(\\neg\\dot\\in(x,t)\\lor\\neg\\varphi)\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}quantifier}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BoundedQuantifier}_S(\\psi,x,t,\\varphi,\\Sigma)\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\dot\\in\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{BoundedQuantifierAt}_S(\\psi,x,t,\\varphi,\\Sigma,\\dot\\in).","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg,\\lor,\\forall","display":false},{"tex":"\\dot\\in(x,t)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in t","display":false}],"bytes":2364,"backlinks":[{"id":"2678ecfefaa83e32","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BoundedQuantifier}_S$ (bounded-quantifier predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-bounded-quantifier]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1471","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-bounded-quantifier.md|58-df-zfc-bounded-quantifier]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","65418b505fc53093"]}